   "speechEnd": 2.924
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-01",
   "text": "管理员的钱包，打开了一个钓鱼页面。",
   "spoken": "管理员的钱包，打开了一个钓鱼页面。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep03/audio/lines/seg1-01.mp3",
   "start": 3.98,
   "dur": 3.312,
   "speechStart": 4.078,
   "speechEnd": 6.459
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-02",
   "text": "他以为自己在领空投，实际调用了攻击者的合约。",
   "spoken": "他以为自己在领空投，实际掉用了攻击者的合约。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep03/audio/lines/seg1-02.mp3",
   "start": 7.512,
   "dur": 4.416,
   "speechStart": 7.61,
   "speechEnd": 11.074
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-03",
   "text": "攻击者的合约，紧接着去调用你的金库。",
   "spoken": "攻击者的合约，紧接着去掉用你的金库。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep03/audio/lines/seg1-03.mp3",
   "start": 12.148,
   "dur": 3.696,
   "speechStart": 12.246,
   "speechEnd": 15.008
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-04",
   "text": "金库的权限检查只有一句：交易的发起人，必须是管理员。",
   "spoken": "金库的权限检查只有一句：交易的发起人，必须是管理员。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep03/audio/lines/seg1-04.mp3",
   "start": 16.064,
   "dur": 5.304,
   "speechStart": 16.162,
   "speechEnd": 20.531
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-05",
   "text": "这次调用，能通过吗？",
   "spoken": "这次掉用，能通过吗？",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep03/audio/lines/seg1-05.mp3",
   "start": 21.588,
   "dur": 2.928,
   "speechStart": 21.686,
   "speechEnd": 23.698
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-06",
   "text": "能。",
   "spoken": "能。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep03/audio/lines/seg1-06.mp3",
   "start": 25.016,
   "dur": 1.872,
   "speechStart": 25.114,
   "speechEnd": 25.637
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-07",
   "text": "这句检查读的是 tx.origin，也就是发起整笔交易的那个外部账户。",
   "spoken": "这句检查读的是 tx.origin，也就是发起整笔交易的那个外部账户。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep03/audio/lines/seg1-07.mp3",
   "start": 27.108,
   "dur": 6.12,
   "speechStart": 27.206,
   "speechEnd": 32.384
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-08",
   "text": "在这里，就是被骗的管理员。中间经过多少个合约，它都不变。",
   "spoken": "在这里，就是被骗的管理员。中间经过多少个合约，它都不变。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep03/audio/lines/seg1-08.mp3",
   "start": 33.448,
   "dur": 6.192,
   "speechStart": 33.546,
   "speechEnd": 38.817
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-09",
   "text": "攻击者没有偷私钥。他借用了管理员的身份。",
   "spoken": "攻击者没有偷私钥。他借用了管理员的身份。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep03/audio/lines/seg1-09.mp3",
   "start": 39.86,
   "dur": 4.2,
   "speechStart": 39.958,
   "speechEnd": 43.217
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-10",
   "text": "要看懂这一步，先要看懂这台机器，EVM。",
   "spoken": "要看懂这一步，先要看懂这台机器，EVM。",
